<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="dark" lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>트리플에스 커뮤니티- 케미명 모음</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Sora:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=forms,container-queries"></script>
    <script src="/js/tailwind.config.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/chemistry.css?v=20">
</head>
<body class="bg-[#0d0e12] text-[#e3e2e8] min-h-screen">
{{>layout/header}}

<main class="main-content chem-page-main">
    <div class="card-box chem-page-card bg-[#16181f]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-[#3a4a46]/30 rounded-2xl p-3 sm:p-4 shadow-xl">
        <div class="chem-page-head flex flex-col gap-2">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-2">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-[#e3e2e8] flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#00f5d4]"></span> 트리플에스 케미명
                </h2>
                <div class="chem-mode-toggle" role="group" aria-label="케미 인원 선택">
                    <button type="button" class="chem-mode-btn is-active" data-mode="pair" aria-pressed="true" onclick="window.__chemSetMode&&window.__chemSetMode('pair')">2인</button>
                    <button type="button" class="chem-mode-btn" data-mode="trio" aria-pressed="false" onclick="window.__chemSetMode&&window.__chemSetMode('trio')">3인</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base font-semibold text-[#e3e2e8]">셀을 클릭하면 케미 설명과 이미지를 볼 수 있어요. 멤버 이름은 프로필로 이동합니다.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="chem-table-wrap" id="chemPairView">
            <table id="chemistryTable" class="chem-table" aria-label="멤버 간 케미명 표">
                <thead id="chemThead"></thead>
                <tbody id="chemTbody">
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="25" class="text-center text-[#b9cac4] py-10 text-sm">케미 표 불러오는 중…</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="chem-trio-placeholder hidden" id="chemTrioView" aria-live="polite">
            <p class="chem-trio-title">3인 케미 준비 중</p>
            <p class="chem-trio-desc">3인 케미 데이터가 아직 없어요. 2인 모드로 돌아가 페어 케미를 볼 수 있어요.</p>
            <button type="button" class="chem-mode-btn chem-trio-back" data-mode="pair" onclick="window.__chemSetMode&&window.__chemSetMode('pair')">2인으로 보기</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

<div id="chemistryModal" class="chem-modal hidden" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="chemistryTitle">
    <div class="chem-modal-panel">
        <button type="button" class="chem-close" aria-label="닫기">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span>
        </button>
        <h3 id="chemistryTitle" class="chem-modal-title"></h3>
        <img id="chemistryImage" class="chem-modal-img" src="" alt="">
        <p id="chemistryDescription" class="chem-modal-desc"></p>
        <div id="chemistryLinks" class="chem-modal-links"></div>
    </div>
</div>

<script src="/js/chemistry.js?v=7"></script>
</body>
</html>
